  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "71745e6f-dfac-3a1d-547d-6505f0edb1b2",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "24dcebc1-5a7b-2c8f-5613-7105e63c372f",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "1. Information and Insights: ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Virtual open days provide prospective students with a wealth of information about the institution, its programs, faculty, and campus facilities. It's an excellent opportunity to gain insights into what makes AKU-ISMC unique.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "2. Interact with Expert Academics:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " Attending a virtual open day allows you to hear from the institute's expert academics. They can provide valuable information about the courses, research opportunities, and the academic environment at AKU-ISMC.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "3. Student Perspective:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " Hearing from student representatives provides a unique perspective on what it's like to study at AKU-ISMC. They can share their personal experiences, insights, and answer questions about student life.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "4. Q&A and Support: ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Virtual open days typically include Q&A sessions where you can get answers to your specific questions. This is helpful for clarifying doubts about admission requirements, financial aid, or any other concerns you may have.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "5. Convenience: ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Virtual open days offer the convenience of attending from the comfort of your own home, eliminating the need for travel and making it accessible to a broader audience.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "6. Application Guidance: ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "AKU-ISMC can provide guidance on the application process during the virtual open day. This can be immensely helpful in ensuring you submit a strong application.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Virtual open days are an effective and convenient way to explore educational opportunities at AKU-ISMC, and they offer valuable insights into what the institution has to offer. If you're considering studying at AKU-ISMC, participating in one of these events is a great first step in your journey. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "attrs": {
                "level": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Book your place",
                  "type": "text"
                },
